# Agent transcripts and caches. aider writes the FULL conversation to
# .aider.chat.history.md in the working tree. On a repo containing client
# matter that file is the leak the whole gateway design exists to prevent,
# arriving by a route that never touches a model. Never commit these.
.aider*
